WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.236
Brad: But the door was right there!

2
00:00:03.237 --> 00:00:05.671
Tina: I know where it was.

3
00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.714
Danny: How is that possible?

4
00:00:08.715 --> 00:00:11.215
Brad: We’re doomed!

5
00:00:11.217 --> 00:00:13.848
Tina: Now, let’s not get scared.

6
00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:15.415
Danny: Why not?

7
00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:19.871
Tina: Because if there’s a way in, there’s got to be a way out.

8
00:00:19.872 --> 00:00:23.617
Brad: Let me ask my computer!

9
00:00:23.618 --> 00:00:25.347
Danny: Well?

10
00:00:25.348 --> 00:00:28.827
Brad: I asked it, "What’s the best way to get out?"

11
00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.583
Danny: And what did it say?

12
00:00:31.584 --> 00:00:35.528
Brad: It said, "Find an exit."

13
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:38.356
Danny: That computer is useless!

14
00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:40.336
Tina: Danny, calm down.

15
00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:43.832
Brad: She’s right. Getting upset won’t help.

16
00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:48.942
Danny: Well, being calm isn’t helping.

17
00:00:48.943 --> 00:00:51.649
Tina: It’s as if we’re in the woods.

18
00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.844
Brad: Lost in the woods, that’s us.

19
00:00:55.845 --> 00:00:58.156
Danny: I can make a compass!

20
00:00:58.157 --> 00:00:59.672
Tina: What?

21
00:00:59.673 --> 00:01:06.725
Danny: A compass! We find out which direction to go with a compass.

22
00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:09.474
There, that way is north.

23
00:01:09.475 --> 00:01:12.219
Brad: What good does that do?

24
00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.146
Danny: Well . . .

25
00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:19.320
Tina: If we keep walking in one direction, I’m sure we’ll find something.

26
00:01:19.321 --> 00:01:24.366
Danny: She’s right. Standing here won’t help.

27
00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:27.510
Brad: Something feels funny.

28
00:01:27.512 --> 00:01:33.533
Danny: Yeah, the ground is all squishy.

29
00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:36.368
Tina: My shoes are getting wet.

30
00:01:36.369 --> 00:01:39.743
Brad: Yeah. Mine too.

31
00:01:39.744 --> 00:01:43.940
Tina: The ground is getting squishier!

32
00:01:43.941 --> 00:01:47.903
Brad: Our feet are sinking in.

33
00:01:47.904 --> 00:01:52.269
Danny: Whoa!

34
00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:58.716
Brad: You must have stepped on a geyser!

35
00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:00.726
Tina: Look at that!

36
00:02:00.727 --> 00:02:05.629
Danny: Our footsteps are making puddles.

37
00:02:05.631 --> 00:02:09.318
Brad: This isn’t good!

38
00:02:09.319 --> 00:02:12.671
Tina: Let’s start running!

39
00:02:12.672 --> 00:02:16.849
Danny: I can’t get my feet out!

40
00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.033
Brad: This is really bad!

41
00:02:19.034 --> 00:02:23.289
Tina: I wish I were a giant so I could just leap out of this.

42
00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:30.575
Brad: If you were a giant, you’d just sink faster.

43
00:02:30.576 --> 00:02:36.055
Danny: What are we going to do?

